 FY 2026; Q1 FY2026 earnings call summary","url":"https://futurumgroup.com/insights/applied-materials-q3-fy-2026-advanced-packaging-and-dram-accelerate-growth/","excerpt":"Applied's largest customers are now providing 8-quarter rolling demand forecasts","excerpt_from":"snippet","as_of":"unknown","direction":"+","affects":["thesis.H","moat_trend"]},{"claim":"AMAT 營收對中國客戶曝險高，出口管制與貿易政策為敏感點；管理層稱已將已知 CFIUS 與出口管制假設納入展望。","source":"Futurum: Applied Materials Q1 FY 2026 earnings call","url":"https://futurumgroup.com/insights/applied-materials-q1-fy-2026-ai-demand-lifts-outlook/","excerpt":"Applied Materials has historically derived a significant portion of its sales from Chinese customers","excerpt_from":"snippet","as_of":"unknown","direction":"-","affects":["thesis.R","decision_inputs.bear"]}],"note":"搜尋結果未提供明確「結構性 vs 週期性」論述，亦無記憶體廠 capex 紀律的來源；多數 as_of 未見於摘要故標 unknown（AMAT Q1 FY26 call 約 2026-02、Q3 FY26 約 2026-08 僅為推測不採）；excerpt 多為搜尋工具轉述，非逐字故多填 null。"}}}